{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "145295f6-e02d-4233-8274-aee84c8bac8f",
    "name": "Farmer Registry Dashboard Service",
    "description": "Read-only aggregate API of the farmer registry, used by the OAN dashboards.\n\n- Every chart: `GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/charts/<chartId>` returns a JSON array of rows.\n- Filters (all optional, combined with AND) are included on each request but disabled; enable the ones you need. `all` or omitted means no filter.\n  - `region`, `zone`, `woreda`, `kebele`: administrative unit codes for levels 1-4, bare (`ET04`) or full level id (`region-ET04`).\n  - `farmingType`: farming type, case-insensitive (`crop`, `livestock`, `mixed`, ...).\n  - `recordState`: record status, case-insensitive. Without it, only ACTIVE records are counted (except `farmersByRecordState`).\n- Categorical values are registry codes (FEMALE, UNDER_25, OWNER, ...).\n- The collection-level test checks status 200 and the exact response keys per chart.\n\nSet `baseUrl` (collection variable, or the environment) to the service URL. The service has no authentication and is meant to be reachable on the private network only.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "49316197",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/49316197-145295f6-e02d-4233-8274-aee84c8bac8f?source=collection_link"
  },
